{"3520280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rackpunk: A Wasteland Hustle", "steam_appid": 3520280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play fun pool games</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520280/extras/d236c7d87093e17043070a6cad80f061.poster.avif?t=1774721098\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520280/extras/d236c7d87093e17043070a6cad80f061.webm?t=1774721098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520280/extras/d236c7d87093e17043070a6cad80f061.mp4?t=1774721098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Try not to die</strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520280/extras/c940ba4425ae3f8cec885010d4a8b4bf.poster.avif?t=1774721098\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520280/extras/c940ba4425ae3f8cec885010d4a8b4bf.webm?t=1774721098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520280/extras/c940ba4425ae3f8cec885010d4a8b4bf.mp4?t=1774721098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world ended. Now scores get settled on the pool table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rackpunk is post-apocalyptic roguelike pool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Key Features:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your Rack</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire, upgrade, or destroy unique pool balls to build the ultimate rack</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Overlapping Systems</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tools, weapons, and environmental interactions to bend the rules of pool in your favor.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight the Room</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every ball you sink damages the environment. Bars rattle, lights flicker, and the entire room starts to fall apart. A gang isn’t beaten until you’ve destroyed their turf.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Rustpunk Wasteland</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gritty Rustpunk aesthetic inspired by grimy Xbox 360-era action and stylized chaos. Hustle through ruined dive bars, flooded basements, cult churches, and other places where the world never really ended.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520280/extras/c8cb4cb06c1103e4ce463be59ed0012d.poster.avif?t=1774721098\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520280/extras/c8cb4cb06c1103e4ce463be59ed0012d.webm?t=1774721098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520280/extras/c8cb4cb06c1103e4ce463be59ed0012d.mp4?t=1774721098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520280/extras/666bd9ed55fa8f9d8c6f4aabf6cbb937.poster.avif?t=1774721098\" width=852 height=480 ><source sr